WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.725
Jump Start Website.

00:00:01.725 --> 00:00:05.352
Build a website from scratch, with no coding at all.

00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:13.514
A brand-new Jump Start Website starts almost empty: one Hello World page, a menu, and a footer.

00:00:13.514 --> 00:00:20.336
In the next few minutes, we'll turn it into a small website for an example business, Willow Studio.

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.854
First, sign in as the administrator.

00:00:23.854 --> 00:00:27.094
This login was created when the site was installed.

00:00:27.094 --> 00:00:32.940
After signing in, you land on the admin dashboard, where you change everything on your site.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.885
Open Settings, and edit the site's setup.

00:00:36.885 --> 00:00:43.382
On the General tab, give the site its name, the owner's name, and a copyright line for the footer.

00:00:43.382 --> 00:00:46.100
On the Appearance tab, choose the colors.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.685
Here, a green header and a dark footer.

00:00:48.685 --> 00:00:49.348
Then save.

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:54.917
Your changes are kept as a draft, so nothing changes for visitors until you publish.

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:57.934
Next, upload your pictures.

00:00:57.934 --> 00:01:02.668
In Media, choose the files, or drop them on the page, and press Upload.

00:01:02.668 --> 00:01:07.936
Each picture is named after its file, and is ready to use anywhere on the site.

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:11.508
Now open Pages, and the home page.

00:01:11.508 --> 00:01:16.605
Its workspace has an outline of the page, a preview, and an editing panel.

00:01:16.605 --> 00:01:20.187
In Page settings, change the page's title, and save.

00:01:20.187 --> 00:01:25.835
Then hide the starter section: click it, switch off Enabled, and save the section.

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:28.910
Now add a section of your own.

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:33.211
Choose a template: here, text on the left, and a picture on the right.

00:01:33.211 --> 00:01:34.932
Type the text in the editor.

00:01:34.932 --> 00:01:39.786
Use the toolbar to make the first line a heading, then write a sentence or two.

00:01:39.786 --> 00:01:42.183
Choose the picture that goes beside it.

00:01:42.183 --> 00:01:47.959
Press Generate Columns to build the section's two columns, check them, and press Save Section.

00:01:47.959 --> 00:01:51.953
You're back in the workspace, and the new section is on the page.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.640
Let's make it look finished.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:04.438
Open the text column, go to its Layout tab, and tick Use rounded borders.

00:02:04.438 --> 00:02:08.448
That puts the text in a rounded white box with a soft shadow.

00:02:08.448 --> 00:02:09.499
Save the column.

00:02:09.499 --> 00:02:15.612
Then open the picture column, and on its Image tab, tick Round the picture corners, and save.

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:18.501
Next, add a second page.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:20.515
Under Pages, choose New page.

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:25.448
Give it a title, a name, which becomes its address, and a section name.

00:02:25.448 --> 00:02:28.782
Save it, and open the new page in its workspace.

00:02:28.782 --> 00:02:41.287
Add a section the same way as before: choose a template, this time with the picture on the left, type a heading and a short story, choose a picture, generate the columns, and save.

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:53.132
To put the new page in the menu, open Menus, and add an item.

00:02:53.132 --> 00:02:56.398
Give it a label, About, and the address it opens.

00:02:56.398 --> 00:02:56.865
Add it.

00:02:56.865 --> 00:03:02.930
New items go at the end, so use the arrows to move it up, until it sits right next to Home.

00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:08.525
Everything so far is a draft, so visitors haven't seen any of it.

00:03:08.525 --> 00:03:12.079
Press Publish to review the changes, grouped by page.

00:03:12.079 --> 00:03:16.035
Select them all, add a short note if you like, and publish.

00:03:16.035 --> 00:03:17.712
Every change is now live.

00:03:18.933 --> 00:03:23.718
And here is the finished site: its own name, colors, pictures, and pages.

00:03:23.718 --> 00:03:27.323
Scroll down to the footer, with the new copyright line.

00:03:27.323 --> 00:03:30.535
And click About in the menu to open the new page.

00:03:36.567 --> 00:03:39.545
That's it: a new website, built from scratch.

00:03:39.545 --> 00:03:45.106
The Help and New Site Tutorial pages in the admin explain every step in more detail.
